{"id": "DdrpcQ2zcuq", "title": "Video by nocodealex", "description": "Comment “WATCH” and I’ll DM you the repo link, free. Follow so the DM lands 📩 \n\n👇 READ BELOW for what it does and how to use it\n\nIt’s a free, open source Claude Code skill with over 17,000 stars on GitHub.\n\n1️⃣ Paste any video link\nYouTube, Loom, TikTok, Instagram, X, Vimeo and a few hundred more sites. Local video files work too.\n\n2️⃣ Ask it anything\nType /watch, paste the link, then your question. “What hook did they open with?” is a great first one.\n\n3️⃣ It actually watches\nIt pulls a frame from every scene change plus a timestamped transcript, then Claude reads every frame as an image.\n\nWhat people use it for:\n\nBreaking down a viral video’s hook, second by second.\n\nFinding the exact frame where a bug shows up in a screen recording.\n\nTurning a long tutorial into notes, or into a custom skill you can reuse in Claude or ChatGPT.\n\nGood to know: captions are free and cover most public videos. You only need a Whisper API key when a video has no captions.\n\nSave this for your next research session.\n\nComment “WATCH” and I’ll send you the link. #claudeai #claude #claudetips #claudecode", "channel": "nocodealex", "uploader_id": "17400675810", "uploader": "Alex AI", "timestamp": 1790278514, "like_count": 1176, "comment_count": 1536, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1796572634731016a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 44.519, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPK-TmTxV7hxf0tSBRvoV-aapbwTVem09xfhlGwt1eDVDxEHlwOfU5t5_7aV1vUCLfedO-PCS20a_LQQZBzIduShisSFLjMPrEvTnI.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=nTwEg-shIOEQ7kNvwG0tN02&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=WpHmZ1Npu7mWTrgo2jm-kA&_nc_ss=7a580&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQWWRM9cmEnTetm1mFD9dPP-Uf_RB_uNLg-